<title>USA: E Trade files to sell 7.0 mln shares.</title>
<headline>E Trade files to sell 7.0 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>E TRADE Group Inc filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the proposed public offering of seven million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Of these shares, five million will be offered by the Company and 2 million will be offered by certain selling shareholders.</p>
</text>
